WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.197
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Ask Better Questions.

2
00:00:05.497 --> 00:00:10.332
Turn a vague question into a clear one. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:11.317 --> 00:00:15.792
Step one. A vague question like tell me about health gives a vague answer.

4
00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:25.211
Step two. Add details. Who is it for, what do you want, and how much. For example, three cheap, quick breakfast ideas for a student.

5
00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:33.007
Step three. Ask for steps. Say, explain step by step. The answer becomes easy to follow.

6
00:00:34.017 --> 00:00:40.991
Step four. If the answer is too difficult, say, explain it more simply. You are in control of the conversation.

7
00:00:41.983 --> 00:00:45.623
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:45.923 --> 00:00:49.478
Make this question better: Tell me about English.

9
00:00:49.778 --> 00:00:52.010
Ask for a step-by-step answer.

10
00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:55.563
Ask the AI to explain an answer more simply.

11
00:00:55.863 --> 00:00:56.910
Well done!

